-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §58 הסכמים קודמים: the terms set in the past
-- in collective agreements, collective arrangements or other written
-- undertakings stay in force in the agreement's term, unless one of its
-- provisions amended or cancelled them, expressly or by implication.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-3`

§ `58 הסכמים קודמים`

-- ¶1: an earlier term stays in force, in the agreement's term (§3), unless
-- a provision of this agreement amended or cancelled it, expressly or by
-- implication. Whether one did is a reading of the two texts: a fact of
-- the case here.
@ref akn:art_58/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `amended or cancelled by the Oz agreement, expressly or by implication` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force under section 58 on` d `amended or cancelled by the Oz agreement, expressly or by implication` IF
        `in the Oz agreement's period` d
    AND NOT `amended or cancelled by the Oz agreement, expressly or by implication`

#ASSERT `an earlier term stays in force under section 58 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `an earlier term stays in force under section 58 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) TRUE
